<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">The Company will reimburse Advisor for
reasonable business, commuting, travel and lodging expenses incurred in connection with attending meetings or while performing Advisory
